Audio Duration: 5m 42.6s (342.59s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:47:43 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 11 | Text: 講講怎麼企號,你學這個東西,沒有用
Segment #2   [00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,600] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 13 | Text: 任何人的方法論,它是不適合你
Segment #3   [00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,220] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是我們大家所了解到的
Segment #4   [00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,320] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 15 | Text: 無論是直播間主播講的所謂的乾貨
Segment #5   [00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,720] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 13 | Text: 也可能是你刷短片,別人給你聊的
Segment #6   [00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,660] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 13 | Text: 什麼三天如何企號,十天如何到十萬分
Segment #7   [00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,820] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 所有人給你分享的話題
Segment #8   [00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,920] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 它的方法不一定是用於你
Segment #9   [00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,820] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 12 | Text: 而且你再去做一個事情的初心有問題
Segment #10  [00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:26,700] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 14 | Text: 這個互聯網,我給大家舉個很簡單的例子
Segment #11  [00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,380] | Elapsed:  13.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是你要把錢和事分開
Segment #12  [00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要能聽懂我接下來說的話
Segment #13  [00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,800] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 12 | Text: 你做互聯網,我不說你一定能做到
Segment #14  [00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,740] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 14 | Text: 二十萬粉絲,五十萬粉絲,能賺到錢
Segment #15  [00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,900] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是最起碼就是我說的這個東西
Segment #16  [00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,240] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 11 | Text: 你不理解的話,你大概率做不起來
Segment #17  [00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,420] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 12 | Text: 因為你的根有問題,你的觸發點是錯的
Segment #18  [00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,120] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 6  | Text: 什麼是錢,什麼是事
Segment #19  [00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,180] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 11 | Text: 你比如說我知道,我們關了我的朋友當中
Segment #20  [00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,220] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 5  | Text: 大部分人,他都是
Segment #21  [00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:50,940] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 7  | Text: 你問他你的夢想是什麼
Segment #22  [00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,300] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 7  | Text: 他說我要做有錢的人樣
Segment #23  [00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,880] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 8  | Text: 我要賺好多好多的錢
Segment #24  [00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,600] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 9  | Text: 我要找一個非常有錢的老公
Segment #25  [00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,900] | Elapsed:  29.26s | Words: 10 | Text: 他滿腦子都是奔著錢去的
Segment #26  [00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,920] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 你越這樣,你越賺不到錢
Segment #27  [00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:03,340] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 你越做賭易你的初心事
Segment #28  [00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:05,200] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 我要賺多少錢,我要找多少粉絲
Segment #29  [00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,300] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 你一定做不了
Segment #30  [00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,620] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 因為你的初心有問題
Segment #31  [00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,800] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 11 | Text: 就我給大家舉個更簡單直白的
Segment #32  [00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,120] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是巨像化的例子
Segment #33  [00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,380] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 你去接觸一個有錢的人
Segment #34  [00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:15,220] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 11 | Text: 你越想他從他兜里去掏錢
Segment #35  [00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:16,080] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 你越掏不到
Segment #36  [00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,520] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 10 | Text: 你比你有錢的人一定不比你傻
Segment #37  [00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:20,600] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 13 | Text: 兄弟們,你們把這句話打到評論區
Segment #38  [00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,340] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是課代表
Segment #39  [00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:23,440] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 13 | Text: 我怕剛才有錢來的用戶都看不到
Segment #40  [00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:27,700] | Elapsed:  46.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 比你有錢的人一定不比你傻
Segment #41  [00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,460] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 那你所有時候你做很多的事情
Segment #42  [00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:31,180] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 他是不能奔著錢去的
Segment #43  [00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:33,000] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 就包括你去做短人品
Segment #44  [00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,280] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 做自媒體他也是一個道理
Segment #45  [00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,720] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 你現在去做自媒體
Segment #46  [00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:38,700] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 11 | Text: 你說觀眾現在從最早的某數時代
Segment #47  [00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:39,360] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 到今天為止
Segment #48  [00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,160] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 忽然往來十年
Segment #49  [00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,600] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 用戶比你多聰明
Segment #50  [00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:42,720] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 3  | Text: 什麼他不知道
Segment #51  [00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:43,580] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 5  | Text: 什麼他看不看
Segment #52  [00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:45,260] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 所以說你要去做這件事
Segment #53  [00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:46,900] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 10 | Text: 無論哪怕是現實中創業
Segment #54  [00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,600] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 你要奔著把事做好
Segment #55  [00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,980] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 把事做到極致
Segment #56  [00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:51,860] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 只有當你把事做好了以後
Segment #57  [00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:52,640] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 錢才會了
Segment #58  [00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,840] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 這樣量能聽懂嗎
Segment #59  [00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:55,540] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 那我再給大家舉一個
Segment #60  [00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:56,920] | Elapsed:  64.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 比較巨像化的例子
Segment #61  [00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:59,340] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 8  | Text: 大家有沒有知道那個國愛林的
Segment #62  [00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:00,280] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 3  | Text: 他是滑雪
Segment #63  [00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,460] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 5  | Text: 他是滑雪官軍
Segment #64  [00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,220] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 7  | Text: 然後當他火了以後
Segment #65  [00:02:03,220 --> 00:02:04,460] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 7  | Text: 他賺了很多很多的錢
Segment #66  [00:02:04,460 --> 00:02:05,320] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 6  | Text: 接了很多的廣告
Segment #67  [00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:09,260] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 13 | Text: 但是他在去做滑雪這件事的初心
Segment #68  [00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:11,180] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就不是為了賺錢
Segment #69  [00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:13,580] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 6  | Text: 他說我是為了賺錢
Segment #70  [00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,360] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 5  | Text: 他會這樣做嗎
Segment #71  [00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,440] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 4  | Text: 不是我這樣講
Segment #72  [00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,200] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 4  | Text: 你們能不能懂
Segment #73  [00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:19,840] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 13 | Text: 就是國愛林在去做滑雪這件事的時候
Segment #74  [00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,220] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 9  | Text: 他想的也不是我要賺多少錢
Segment #75  [00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:23,420] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果我想的賺多少錢
Segment #76  [00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,600] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 5  | Text: 我幹嘛去滑雪
Segment #77  [00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,580] | Elapsed:  79.97s | Words: 3  | Text: 很累的
Segment #78  [00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:27,060] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 我有可能我把胳膊腿摔斷了
Segment #79  [00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:27,940] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 我可能重生殘疑
Segment #80  [00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,380] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 這是一個體力活
Segment #81  [00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,320] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 而且是高威動作
Segment #82  [00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,240] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 那比如說
Segment #83  [00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,340] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 13 | Text: 我哪怕我就是奔著錢去做這件事
Segment #84  [00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:35,320] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 也有很多的能賺錢的行業
Segment #85  [00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,960] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 不需要去承擔這麼大的風險
Segment #86  [00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,680] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 8  | Text: 我一樣能去做理這件事情
Segment #87  [00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,460] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 能把錢賺到
Segment #88  [00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:40,720] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以說我的初心
Segment #89  [00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,300] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 就不是通過滑雪來賺錢
Segment #90  [00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:44,660] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 是我只有把滑雪的事做好了
Segment #91  [00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:45,720] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 那我得了世界冠軍
Segment #92  [00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,540] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 然後我又賺到了錢
Segment #93  [00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:50,180] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 11 | Text: 你就包括我非常喜歡的一個電影明星
Segment #94  [00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:50,860] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 叫張家輝
Segment #95  [00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:53,600] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是師兄弟來看我這個渣渣輝
Segment #96  [00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:54,740] | Elapsed:  98.77s | Words: 2  | Text: 他也是
Segment #97  [00:02:55,220 --> 00:02:56,680] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 我只有把事做好了
Segment #98  [00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,640] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 我才能拿到影帝
Segment #99  [00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,840] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 我去拍戲的時候
Segment #100 [00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,160] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 我沒有想過我拿影帝
Segment #101 [00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,720] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 和謝霆鋒一個道理
Segment #102 [00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,600] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 有沒有人天生做不到極致的
Segment #103 [00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:03,960] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 1  | Text: 沒有
Segment #104 [00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,800] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 所有的東西都是可以練習的
Segment #105 [00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,140] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 謝霆鋒他是一個富二代
Segment #106 [00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:08,360] | Elapsed: 117.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 他去拍戲的時候
Segment #107 [00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,300] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 他也沒有想過
Segment #108 [00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:10,240] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 我一定要多影帝
Segment #109 [00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,060] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 他原本可以補作的
Segment #110 [00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:13,340] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是我隨便出幾張專輯
Segment #111 [00:03:13,340 --> 00:03:13,940] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 我唱唱歌
Segment #112 [00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:15,240] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 我一樣可以賺很多的錢
Segment #113 [00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:17,280] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 因為本身我父親就非常的牛逼
Segment #114 [00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,220] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 8  | Text: 那我們又不要去做這件事情了
Segment #115 [00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:21,780] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 13 | Text: 而且你們要認真地研究過謝霆鋒的
Segment #116 [00:03:21,780 --> 00:03:23,620] | Elapsed: 117.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 我記得我看到他一個回訪片上
Segment #117 [00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:25,080] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是他在去拍戲的時候
Segment #118 [00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,760] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 他被拎到窒息
Segment #119 [00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,280] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是為了把一個鏡頭研好
Segment #120 [00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,200] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 就這種的心態
Segment #121 [00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:33,200] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 和你們去做一件事情的心態
Segment #122 [00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:33,920] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 3  | Text: 完全不一樣
Segment #123 [00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,380] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 你們太急了
Segment #124 [00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,520] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 你們真的太急了
Segment #125 [00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,580] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 你們總想著是我短期內
Segment #126 [00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:40,860] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 我必須要賺多少錢
Segment #127 [00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,420] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 當然我說這個話
Segment #128 [00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:43,480] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 可能很多人理解不了
Segment #129 [00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:43,960] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 3  | Text: 理解不了
Segment #130 [00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,200] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 咱就繼續做群人了
Segment #131 [00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,860] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 10 | Text: 現在互聯網人心很浮躁的
Segment #132 [00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:50,260] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 12 | Text: 就是真正有價值有營養的內容
Segment #133 [00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:50,880] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 3  | Text: 沒人看
Segment #134 [00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,600] | Elapsed: 134.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 反而你們提倡在這兒嘛
Segment #135 [00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,500] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 3  | Text: 沒人了
Segment #136 [00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,900] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 為啥要努力
Segment #137 [00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:55,900] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 兄弟我就懷疑你怎麼辦
Segment #138 [00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:59,400] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 大部分人現在信奉的是這種東西
Segment #139 [00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,700] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你們太急了
Segment #140 [00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:05,680] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 而且你不願意去承擔
Segment #141 [00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,020] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 別人所付出的努力
Segment #142 [00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,160] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 還羨慕別人的結果
Segment #143 [00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:10,020] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 不想出力還想賺錢
Segment #144 [00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:10,940] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 現在你還拿個這種事
Segment #145 [00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,920] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 你所謂的窮怕了
Segment #146 [00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:13,560] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 你一點不窮
Segment #147 [00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,660] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 你還沒逼到費上
Segment #148 [00:04:14,660 --> 00:04:15,760] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 你真是吃不上飯
Segment #149 [00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,760] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 上無片碗折身
Segment #150 [00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,980] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 下無力入之地的時候
Segment #151 [00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:18,940] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就能耗錢來了
Segment #152 [00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:20,360] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 3  | Text: 為什麼沒錢
Segment #153 [00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,400] | Elapsed: 151.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 為什麼賺不到錢
Segment #154 [00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,660] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 你逼到費上
Segment #155 [00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,820] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 真的心話
Segment #156 [00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:24,540] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是我看你們
Segment #157 [00:04:24,540 --> 00:04:24,880] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 2  | Text: 我現在
Segment #158 [00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,760] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 11 | Text: 我就跟你們那肚子裡的灰塚一樣
Segment #159 [00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:28,880] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就是沒逼到費上
Segment #160 [00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,420] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 你逼到費上什麼都出來了
Segment #161 [00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:32,440] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 我再給你們一個例子
Segment #162 [00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,580] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 現在給你一個硬性規定
Segment #163 [00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,740] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 不找到10萬粉絲
Segment #164 [00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:36,940] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 第二天就卡包你
Segment #165 [00:04:36,940 --> 00:04:38,620] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 你說你能拍到10萬粉絲了
Segment #166 [00:04:38,620 --> 00:04:39,480] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 回答我
Segment #167 [00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,860] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 兄弟們你們能不能回答我
Segment #168 [00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,160] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是給你一個月的時間
Segment #169 [00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:44,140] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 你幹不夠10萬粉絲
Segment #170 [00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,240] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 就冰了送你個小禮物
Segment #171 [00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:47,860] | Elapsed: 168.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 送你個7.62
Segment #172 [00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:51,280] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 9  | Text: 你說你能不能到10萬粉絲
Segment #173 [00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,960] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 11 | Text: 老鐵民你們只回答我這兩個問題
Segment #174 [00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,020] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要講人和的借口
Segment #175 [00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:55,960] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 4  | Text: 就兩選項
Segment #176 [00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,580] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 3  | Text: 能還是不能
Segment #177 [00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:58,000] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 你不可能做不到
Segment #178 [00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,680] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 2  | Text: 不一定
Segment #179 [00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,640] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 9  | Text: 真沒給你逼到那個項上
Segment #180 [00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,040] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 10 | Text: 逼到那個項上你一定能做下來
Segment #181 [00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:03,380] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 3  | Text: 你們知不知道
Segment #182 [00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:04,760] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 為什麼過去的蒙古騎兵
Segment #183 [00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:05,620] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 能夠戰武武勝
Segment #184 [00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:06,540] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是成一四漢
Segment #185 [00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:08,140] | Elapsed: 186.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 老鐵不拿生酸的
Segment #186 [00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:08,880] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 都飄天上去了
Segment #187 [00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:10,840] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 3  | Text: 幸虧他
Segment #188 [00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,840] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 他不是說像天天
Segment #189 [00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:14,060] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 9  | Text: 在街五百年的首歌唱的
Segment #190 [00:05:14,060 --> 00:05:14,560] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 你再給他
Segment #191 [00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,700] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 多用五百年的時間
Segment #192 [00:05:15,700 --> 00:05:16,900] | Elapsed: 186.94s | Words: 8  | Text: 你再給他十年十年
Segment #193 [00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,180] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 9  | Text: 這一股血統打到烏露血
Segment #194 [00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,320] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 為什麼過去的蒙古騎兵
Segment #195 [00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,120] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 5  | Text: 能戰武武勝
Segment #196 [00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,220] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 5  | Text: 因為他們的開甲
Segment #197 [00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:22,800] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 3  | Text: 只有一面
Segment #198 [00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,700] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 從來沒有撤退科研
Segment #199 [00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:25,660] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是我幹一件事
Segment #200 [00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:26,600] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 我就是泡浮沉舟
Segment #201 [00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,120] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 2  | Text: 幹完了
Segment #202 [00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,420] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以說你們根本
Segment #203 [00:05:29,420 --> 00:05:30,760] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 5  | Text: 沒逼到項上
Segment #204 [00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,960] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 你們是在舒適圈裡
Segment #205 [00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:32,520] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 4  | Text: 待的太久
Segment #206 [00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,220] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 5  | Text: 包括這邊的同仁
Segment #207 [00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:34,740] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 2  | Text: 你們也是
Segment #208 [00:05:34,740 --> 00:05:35,860] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 3  | Text: 你們也是因為
Segment #209 [00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:37,160] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 9  | Text: 在舒適圈裡待的太久
Segment #210 [00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,320] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 小六這位同事
Segment #211 [00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:38,540] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 1  | Text: 對了
Segment #212 [00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:40,180] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 心不死的道不生
Segment #213 [00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:42,000] | Elapsed: 203.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 人道絕舒適重生
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
